    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISD201 · Chapter 10 · Session 46 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 46 — Progress Test 3 — Ch.8–11 (45 min)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14525 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISD201 · Chương 10 · Buổi 46 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 46 — Progress Test 3 — Ch.8–11 (45 min)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14525 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offfline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offfline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Progress Test 3 — Ch.8–11 (45 min)<br>• Closed book: MCQ + short-answer<br>• CLO3: enterprise systems, e-commerce models, KM<br>• CLO6: BI, analytics, decision-making support<br>• CLO7: cybersecurity, ethics, security controls</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>PT3 question paper<br>Review summary Ch.8–11<br>Key terms list Ch.8–11</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>BEFORE: Revise Ch.8–11; review security, ERP/CRM/SCM, e-commerce, KM<br>DURING: Sit Progress Test 3 (45 min, closed book)<br>AFTER: Note difficult areas; review after grades released</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
